    "scenario": "A newborn is diagnosed prenatally with Tetralogy of Fallot/Pulmonary Atresia and is now on a PGE infusion awaiting surgery. She gets very upset during an IV placement and becomes deeply cyanotic. What can relieve this cyanosis rapidly with minimal adverse effects?",
