    "scenario": "A 1 m.o. presents from the ER with severe respiratory distress. His chest X-ray reveals pulmonary edema. He is tachycardic with bounding pedal pulses and blood pressure 72/43. As you consider congenital heart defects in your differential, which is unlikely?",
