    "scenario": "A 2 y.o. with severe viral myocarditis is placed on ECMO as a bridge to transplantation. She returns to the PICU after her transplant which by all reports went well but is in cardiogenic shock requiring inotropes. What is the most likely cause of her myocardial dysfunction?",
