    "correctAnswer": "E",
    "correctAnswerText": "Septation of lung saccules gives rise to alveoli",
    "explanation": "Alveoli form when the terminal saccules divide (septate). At birth most terminal air sacs are still saccules, and alveolar development from saccules continues after birth.",
