    "scenario": "You are caring for a 3-week- old (who was born at 31 weeks of gestation) with acute bronchiolitis who is receiving non-invasive ventilation. One of the residents who will be rotating in the NICU next month asks you about stages of lung development. She asks you “at the end of which stage is lung considered viable?” Your appropriate response should be?",
