    "scenario": "You are attempting to measure the functional residual capacity (FRC) by helium dilution technique in an adolescent with cystic fibrosis (CF). The original concentration of helium in the system was 9% and at equilibrium it is down to 6%. The spirometry volume was kept at 6 liters. Which of the following most closely represents the FRC?",
