    "scenario": "This infant is on time-cycled pressure-limited ventilation and is receiving continuous vecuronium infusion. He received a positive inflation pressure of 24 cm H2O for each of the curves shown. Which of the following curves shown below is associated with the lowest static lung compliance?",
