    "scenario": "The X-ray below is of a 13 y.o. with life-threatening asthma who was intubated in the ED for depressed mental status and is now on conventional mechanical ventilation (CMV) in the PICU. He is on IV midazolam, fentanyl, and vecuronium infusions Which of the following best reflects an improvement in airway resistance over time while he is on mechanical ventilation?",
