    "scenario": "A 15-year-old boy, who was ejected from a vehicle while unrestrained in the rear seat, is noted to be moaning, flexes nonspecifically when a painful stimulus is applied to his index and middle fingers with a pen, however he does not open his eyes with this stimulation. His Glasgow Coma Scale (GCS) score is:",
