    "scenario": "A 15-month-old boy, who was involved in a motor vehicle collision, is brought by the Emergency Medical Services to the hospital. In response to a painful stimulus applied to the baby’s forehead, the baby cries persistently, moves his arms to his chest with flexion at the wrist, and eyes remain closed. The GCS in this baby is:",
