    "scenario": "A 7-year-old (25 kg) boy is admitted to the PICU following resection of a suprasellar mass. You are called by the bedside nurse who has noticed large volume (~1.5 Liters) of clear urine over the past 2 hours. You order a serum Na+ and the results show that it is 165 mEq/L. These findings are consistent with:",
