    "displayScenario": "Shared case from source Q163: The NICU at your hospital performed a screening test on on 130 high-risk newborns who received IV gentamicin after birth and were at risk for hearing loss. The investigator tells you that each patient was re-evaluated at 3 years of age with Brain stem auditory evoke response test and the results are shown in the following table: The specificity of this this hearing test is:\n\nSource Q164: Considering the scenario mentioned in the last question: What is the prevalence of hearing loss in this population?"
