    "explanation": "Ipecac and routine gastric lavage are not recommended, and neutralization of acids or alkalis is contraindicated. Hemodialysis suits drugs with a small Vd and low protein binding. Urinary alkalinization is recommended for salicylate poisoning (ion trapping).",
