    "scenario": "A 3 y.o. victim of a house fire was emergently intubated in the field. Upon arrival to the PICU, her saturations are noted to be 92%. Her ventilator settings are as follows: TV 6 cc/kg, rate 18, FiO2 50%, PEEP 5. What should be done next?",
